X: 1
T: Biene Maja
O: Karel Svoboda, 1975
N: German title song of the Maya the Bee anime, sung by Karel Gott. From a
N: midis101.com MIDI (id 23524), channel 3, moved up a semitone from E major to F
N: so the low B3 sits on C4. One pass: the fanfare intro and the first verse; the
N: MIDI repeats both. The verse's swung dotted-eighth/sixteenth pairs are
N: straightened and grace notes dropped; pitches are the source's. Chords fitted
N: from the MIDI's bass and comping.
